        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Then the question is whether `q=` should toggle follow mode per-buffer or globally like before. I'd prefer keeping it global to reduce the mental overhead when switching buffers.\r\n\r\nI hope more people will try the PR and share their opinions.",
