        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I treat it as an overlay mode, more like a state of the primary cursor as it moves between buffers rather than a buffer specific state. In this case, restoring follow mode only makes sense when there are no cursors in any buffer.\r\n\r\nBut I don't want to block the change just based on that feeling. And, in theory, scripting should be easier with the buffer-local option.",
